'''Xanwan's freight kiosk'''<ref name="Trivia Guide">{{SW|url=andor-s1-e2-trivia-gallery|text="That Would Be Me" Trivia Gallery &#124; Andor}} {{C|Slide 4}}</ref> was a transport business run by [[Xanwan]] and his assistant [[Granik]]. It was located on the [[planet]] [[Ferrix]]. A vertical [[Aurebesh]] sign by the entrance read "XANWANS." [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]] came there to book transport to [[Tassar]].<ref name="Andor 2" /> Later, when a group of [[Tac-Corpo|Corpos]] came to the planet looking for Andor, Xanwan was among the many business people who took precautions by immediately locking the doors.<ref name="Andor 3">{{Andor|Reckoning (episode)}}</ref>

